<h1 id="wiki_main_quest">Main Quest</h1>

<p><em>Note: Several of the items needed can be collected in any order, or prior to their respective steps. Likewise, steps can be done in any order or concurrently with others.</em></p>
<div class="cheat-grid">
<div class="cheat-block phase1"><h2 id="wiki_cheat_pool">☁️ ① Swirling Pool</h2>
<ol>
<li>Veytharion's Sanctuary: collect the 4 cubes (pillar by GobbleGum, 2 windows in Mule Kick room, near Void Claw pedestal).</li>
<li>Left opening bottom→top: <strong>Fire, Hand, Water, Leaf</strong>. Shuffle to the right opening → <strong>Water, Leaf, Hand, Fire</strong>. Fire must never touch Leaf/Water; slide empties if a round ends.</li>
<li>Shoot/melee the circle to move the slide. Reward: swirling pool + Random Perk. <strong>Interacting with the pool triggers rain the next round (needed for every temple cleansing).</strong></li>
</ol></div>
<div class="cheat-block phase2"><h2 id="wiki_cheat_forge">⚙️ ② Nexus Forge</h2>
<ol>
<li>With <strong>Void Talon</strong>: free the 3 pillar Pull Switches + 6 panels around the Nexus Core.</li>
<li>Clear the webs (explosives/Molotov, Astral/Ursuper Flam, or Warden's Blight) — Deathspinners spawn.</li>
<li>Purple orb → Pack-a-Punch → surge, then quickly interact the ground Pull Switch next to Deadshot Daiquiri at the Nexus Core bottom.</li>
<li>Pillars around the Forge can now be moved.</li>
</ol></div>
<div class="cheat-block phase3"><h2 id="wiki_cheat_cleanse">🛕 ③ Cleanse the Temples</h2>
<ol>
<li><strong>Align the 3 pillars in front of each temple first.</strong></li>
<li>Per temple: quest item → cauldron + Astral Flame shot → attach floater to a zombie → its symbol matches a Titan Trap shackle (Caltheris / Veytharion Passage) → trap it.</li>
<li>Tile mini-action → reflector: <strong>Dravakar</strong> re-plate several times · <strong>Nyxara</strong> prone · <strong>Caltheris</strong> aim 30 s · <strong>Veytharion</strong> keep jumping.</li>
<li>Lift reflector (charged Warden's Blight) → aim beam at the marked wall → kill zombies beneath → wall breaks.</li>
<li>Shoot Visage → lockdown → destroy 4 Shadow Souls → shoot again until screen turns white.</li>
<li>Purple orb under the face + Warden's Blight lift → purple eyes → rain + Astral Flame to the face point = cleansed.</li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li><strong>Items:</strong> Dravakar — Blacksmith's Hammer (Shatter Blast shields) · Nyxara — Ancient Scroll (Shadow Rift in forest) · Caltheris — Shimmering Thread (purple orbs) · Veytharion — Woven Sash (rain; Spira / Ruinas / Aranea Insula).</li>
</ul></div>
<div class="cheat-block phase4"><h2 id="wiki_cheat_boss">👹 ④ Warden Boss Fight</h2>
<ol>
<li>Start in the Nexus Core circles. Void Claw/Talon recommended — he pushes you out of the arena.</li>
<li><strong>P1:</strong> Dread Skulls (Dead Wire) stun him → shoot the tail critical point.</li>
<li>Immune: destroy Shadow Souls (Light Mend) → <strong>P2:</strong> destroy Stingers (Cryofreeze) or they trigger a wipe; dodge stun circles.</li>
<li>Intermediate room: survive or kill the HVT. <strong>P3:</strong> armor-providing Shadow Souls + skulls. <strong>P4:</strong> more skulls before each stun.</li>
</ol></div>
</div>

<div class="rex-tools"><strong class="rex-tools-label">🧰 Interactive tool:</strong><InlineTool tool="rex-ring" /></div>


