<ol>
<li id="guide-step-map-travel-to-veytharion-s-sanctuary-and-acquire-four-cubes-to-bring-into-">Travel to Veytharion's Sanctuary and acquire four cubes to bring into the room with the Void Claw pedestal. <em>Note: Death Perception makes it easier to see them.</em>
 <ShowOnMap target="veytharion-sanctuary" />
<ul>
<li id="guide-step-map-one-cube-is-located-on-a-pillar-in-the-veytharion-main-chamber-next-to">One cube is located on a pillar in the Veytharion Main Chamber, next to the GobbleGum machine. Simply double jump and interact with the cube to drop it. <ShowOnMap target="veytharion-main-chamber" /></li>
<li>One cube is located on the bottom window in the room with Mule Kick.</li>
<li>One cube is located above the upper window in the room with Mule Kick.</li>
