</ul>
</li>
<li id="guide-step-map-place-the-cubes-on-the-wall-in-the-left-vertical-opening-in-this-order">Place the cubes on the wall in the left vertical opening in this order: <strong>Fire</strong> (bottom) - <strong>Hand</strong> - <strong>Water</strong> - <strong>Leaf</strong> (top).</li>
<li id="guide-step-map-the-goal-is-to-move-the-cubes-from-the-left-vertical-opening-to-the-ri">The goal is to move the cubes from the left vertical opening to the right vertical opening to form this order: <strong>Water</strong> (bottom) - <strong>Leaf</strong> - <strong>Hand</strong> - <strong>Fire</strong> (top)

