<ol>
<li>Put <strong>Hand</strong> and <strong>Fire&nbsp;</strong>cubes in the slide and bring it to the right.</li>
<li>Place the&nbsp;<strong>Fire</strong> cube in the right opening.</li>
<li>Bring back slide to the left.</li>
</ol>
</li>
