<li>Bring back slide to the left.</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>Transfer 3
<ol>
<li>Put <strong>Hand</strong> cube in the left opening first, then put the <strong>Fire</strong> cube.</li>
<li>Put the <strong>Leaf</strong> cube in the slide, then the <strong>Hand</strong> cube.</li>
<li>Place the <strong>Leaf</strong> cube in the right opening.</li>
<li>Bring back the slide to the left.</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li>Transfer 4
<ol>
<li>Put the <strong>Fire</strong> cube in the slide.</li>
<li>Place the <strong>Hand</strong> cube in the right opening first, then the <strong>Fire</strong> cube.</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li id="guide-step-map-if-done-correctly-the-wall-will-open-revealing-the-swirling-pool-and-a">If done correctly, the wall will open revealing the swirling pool and a Random Perk drop.

<ul>
<li><em>Note: Interacting with the swirling pool will trigger rain the next round. <strong>This will be needed for the final step for each temple cleansing.</strong></em></li>
