</li><li id="guide-step-map-shoot-at-the-reflector-with-a-charged-shot-of-the-warden-s-blight-to-l-2">Shoot at the reflector with a charged shot of the Warden's Blight to lift it into the air. The reflector's beam will need to be oriented towards the bottom-left wall of Nyxara Main Chamber, below the ground, near the door leading to Nyxara Inner Sanctum. A vertical/pointy shadow can be seen on that wall, the beam needs to be oriented below that shadow. Shoot the reflector to move the beam around until it is pointing agains that wall. Then kill zombies beneath the reflector to send waves of energy and destroy the wall.
