</ul>
</li></ol></div><div class="rex-phase" style="--pc:#f97316"><div class="rex-phase-head">🔥 Cauldron &amp; Titan Trap</div><ol><li id="guide-step-map-bring-the-woven-sash-to-the-cauldron-in-veytharion-main-chamber-then-l">Bring the <strong>Woven Sash </strong>to the cauldron in Veytharion Main Chamber then light the cauldron with an Astral Flame shot. If done correctly, a piece of flesh will start floading above the cauldron. Bring a zombie near the cauldron so the piece of flesh attaches itself to it. <ShowOnMap target="veytharion-main-chamber" /></li><li id="guide-step-map-a-specific-symbol-will-float-around-the-zombie-and-that-symbol-will-ma-4">A specific symbol will float around the zombie and that symbol will match the shackle of the Titan next to Veytharion' temple. Bring the zombie to the Titan Trap in Veytharion Passage and activate the trap. If done correctly, one of the shackles will be destroyed. <ShowOnMap target="veytharion-passage" /></li></ol></div><div class="rex-phase" style="--pc:#a855f7"><div class="rex-phase-head">🪞 Tile, Reflector &amp; Cleansing</div><p class="rex-ph-note"><em>This step can be done immediately after the pillars have been aligned.</em></p><ol><li id="guide-step-map-return-to-veytharion-main-chamber-and-interact-with-the-tile-on-the-gr">Return to Veytharion Main Chamber and interact with the tile on the ground to trigger a quote. Keeping jumping on the plate until it moves, revealing a reflector.&nbsp;
