<li id="guide-step-map-after-killing-the-hvt-the-unstable-olympia-can-be-picked-up-in-front-o">After killing the HVT, the Unstable Olympia can be picked up in front of the wall-buy. <strong>Quickly return</strong> to Nexus Forge as the weapon will constantly damage you. <ShowOnMap target="nexus-forge" /></li>
<li>Pack-a-Punch the weapon to obtain the <strong>Corrupted Pluto</strong>
