<div class="glass-card glass-green"><h2 id="wiki_power.2Dup_statues"><label class="g-toggle"><input type="checkbox" class="g-cb"><span class="g-title">Power-Up Statues<span class="g-tag">⚡ Statues</span></span><span class="g-chev" aria-hidden="true"></span></label></h2>

<p id="guide-step-locations-areas-her-house--nyxara-passage" data-guide-step>There are 7 Power-Up statues around Rex Infernus giving out the corresponding Power-Ups when shooting them, with two additional statues appearing after the first 7 are activated. <ShowOnMap target="locations-areas-her-house--nyxara-passage" label="Show power-up statues locations on map" /></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p class="" id="guide-step-map-bonus-point-inside-the-structure-outside-the-map-on-the-right-side-of-"><strong>Bonus Point</strong>: Inside the structure outside the map on the right side of Her House when seen from Nyxara Passage.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p id="guide-step-map-insta-kill-inside-the-arch-on-the-right-side-of-the-pit-beneath-nyxara"><strong>Insta-Kill</strong>: Inside the arch on the right side of the pit beneath Nyxara Entrance.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p id="guide-step-map-double-points-in-the-structure-outside-the-map-behind-her-house-when-l"><strong>Double Points</strong>: In the structure outside the map, behind Her House when looking from Caltheris Passage.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p id="guide-step-map-nuke-on-the-flat-roof-of-a-structure-outside-the-map-when-seen-from-ca"><strong>Nuke</strong>: On the flat roof of a structure outside the map when seen from Caltheris Main Chamber.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p id="guide-step-map-full-power-at-the-very-top-of-the-left-pillar-in-veytharion-main-chamb"><strong>Full Power</strong>: At the very top of the left pillar in Veytharion Main Chamber when looking from the entrance of the temple.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p id="guide-step-map-max-armor-on-the-ground-of-the-left-window-in-dravakar-entrance-when-l"><strong>Max Armor</strong>: On the ground of the left window in Dravakar Entrance when looking from the entrance of the temple, requires to jump to see it.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p id="guide-step-map-max-ammo-hidden-behind-the-interactable-painting-in-her-house"><strong>Max Ammo</strong>: Hidden behind the interactable painting in Her House.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p id="guide-step-map-fire-sale-inside-the-structure-outside-the-map-behind-the-mystery-box-"><strong>Fire Sale</strong>: Inside the structure outside the map, behind the Mystery Box location in Spira Insula. <strong>Only available after all the others have been activated.</strong></p>
</li>
<li>
<p id="guide-step-map-random-perk-on-the-bridge-outside-the-map-below-aranea-insula-only-ava"><strong>Random Perk:&nbsp;</strong>On the bridge outside the map below Aranea Insula.&nbsp;<strong>Only available after all the others have been activated.</strong></p>
</li>
</ul></div>
